sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Customer
  participant S as Supervisor
  participant W as WarmHandoffManager
  participant H as Operator console
  C->>S: I want to speak to a human
  S->>W: create manifest (summary, intent, priority, suggested action, tool results)
  W-->>C: Handing over. Reference ESC-xxxx. You will not need to repeat anything.
  H->>W: claim(handover id)
  W-->>H: Summary, history, suggested action
  H->>W: reply(text)
  loop poll every 3s
    C->>S: GET /chat/{session}/messages
    S-->>C: operator messages
  end
  C->>S: further message
  S-->>C: Relayed to operator, no bot answer
  H->>W: resolve
  Note over S: Next customer message goes back to the bot
